PE 794: Seventeen points / 十七个点

=== Combinatorial counts for 17 points on a circle ===
  n = 17 points
  Number of line segments: C(17,2) = 136
  Number of triangles: C(17,3) = 680
  Number of quadrilaterals: C(17,4) = 2380
  Diagonal intersections: C(17,4) = 2380
  Regions by all diagonals: 2501
  Catalan(15) triangulations: 9694845

